OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785919688
OL,3,CCampaign launched for The Vivienne
OL,4,Cstatue in Liverpool's Pride Quarter
OL,6,FLiverpool has announced plans to
OL,7,Fhonour The Vivienne with a life-size
OL,8,Fstatue at the heart of its Pride
OL,9,FQuarter.
OL,11,FJames Lee Williams, known as The
OL,12,FVivienne, was the first winner of
OL,13,FRuPaul's Drag Race and died in January
OL,14,F2025 at the age of 32 after battling
OL,15,FKetamine addiction.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
