CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785919688
OL,3,CCampaign launched for The Vivienne
OL,4,Cstatue in Liverpool's Pride Quarter
OL,6,F'House of The Vivienne CIC',
OL,7,Festablished by their family, and
OL,8,F'Proudly Said' have announced the
OL,9,Fplans to install the permanent statue
OL,10,Fat the junction of Victoria Street and
OL,11,FStanley Street.
OL,13,FLeading on the project, John Hyland,
OL,14,Ffrom Proudly Said, said: "I think it's
OL,15,Fsomething that is needed in this day
OL,16,Fand age. The Vivienne was an absolute
OL,17,Ftrailblazer in today's drag scene.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785919688
OL,3,CCampaign launched for The Vivienne
OL,4,Cstatue in Liverpool's Pride Quarter
OL,6,F"It'll be a lasting tribute to James,
OL,7,FThe Vivienne, it'll be somewhere for
OL,8,Fthe community to have a bit of solace,
OL,9,Fbut also it's the start of a
OL,10,Fconversation with regards to
OL,11,Finvestment in Liverpool's pride
OL,12,Fquarter."
OL,14,FHe added: "The Vivienne was born in
OL,15,FLiverpool. James came here at 16 and
OL,16,Fmade the city their own. He was
OL,17,Fsomeone everyone knew on this scene.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785919688
OL,3,CCampaign launched for The Vivienne
OL,4,Cstatue in Liverpool's Pride Quarter
OL,6,F"They worked in every LGBT venue in
OL,7,Fthis scene across the years. People
OL,8,Fthought The Vivienne, they thought
OL,9,FLiverpool. It'll mean a lot to people
OL,10,Fbecause she meant a lot.
OL,12,F"Where we want to position her looking
OL,13,Ftowards the Pride Quarter, she'll act
OL,14,Fas this guardian angel because she
OL,15,Floved us in life and she'll continue
OL,16,Fto do so as a legacy. I think that's
OL,17,Fwhat is really important.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785919688
OL,3,CCampaign launched for The Vivienne
OL,4,Cstatue in Liverpool's Pride Quarter
OL,6,F"There's an awareness piece around
OL,7,Fthere because she had her silent
OL,8,Fstruggles with addiction and there
OL,9,Fmight be others with a similar journey
OL,10,Fso they can have a chat with Viv.
OL,12,F"It's multifaceted and that just shows
OL,13,Fthe star power of what The Vivienne
OL,14,Fis, was, and will continue to be."
OL,16,FThe project has secured initial
OL,17,Ffunding from Liverpool Business
OL,18,FImprovement District, enabling the
OL,19,Fcampaign to formally launch and the
OL,20,Fcommunity fundraising drive to begin.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
