PN,36806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785919688
OL,3,CCampaign launched for The Vivienne
OL,4,Cstatue in Liverpool's Pride Quarter
OL,6,FChanel Williams, sister of James,
OL,7,Fsaid: "James gave everything to
OL,8,FLiverpool and Liverpool gave
OL,9,Feverything back to him.
OL,11,F"This city saw him, accepted him, and
OL,12,Fhelped him become The Vivienne.
OL,14,F"A permanent statue in the Pride
OL,15,FQuarter feels like the right way to
OL,16,Fmake sure nobody forgets that, and to
OL,17,Fremind anyone who might be struggling
OL,18,Fthat they do not have to do it alone.
OL,20,F"That was what James believed, and it
OL,21,Fis what we are going to keep saying."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
