PN,36807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785919688
OL,3,CCampaign launched for The Vivienne
OL,4,Cstatue in Liverpool's Pride Quarter
OL,6,FBill Addy, CEO of Liverpool Business
OL,7,FImprovement District, said: "Liverpool
OL,8,Fhas always been a city that celebrates
OL,9,Fthe people who shape and help to
OL,10,Fdefine its culture, and The Vivienne
OL,11,Fwas one of them.
OL,13,F"We are proud to support this project
OL,14,Fand what it represents, not just as a
OL,15,Ftribute to James, and all those who
OL,16,Floved and supported James, but as a
OL,17,Fstatement about the kind of city
OL,18,FLiverpool is."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
